# Rotate `o_-` (A2) turns the major cells along the leading axis; the
# amount goes on the left (F6). A positive amount moves items toward
# the front, as in APL, J and BQN, and amounts wrap around. A list of
# amounts means every combination: one rotated copy per amount, along
# a new leading axis (A4).
== SOURCE
1 o_- 1 2 3 4 5
